1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,780
She told New York she was a rich heiress. But she had nothing.

2
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:08,000
She called herself Anna Delvey, a German heiress with a trust fund.

3
00:00:08,520 --> 00:00:11,100
That's family money, waiting for you until you're older.

4
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:15,040
And hers, she said, was worth tens of millions of dollars.

5
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:19,300
But her real name was Anna Sorokin, from Russia, raised in Germany.

6
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:21,220
And that fortune didn't exist.

7
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:25,420
So how do you live rich with no money? You make other people pay.

8
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,580
Hit like if you know someone who never, ever pays.

9
00:00:29,160 --> 00:00:31,860
Here's the trick: first, her card gets declined.

10
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:35,120
Then she blames her bank, and someone else covers the bill.

11
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:38,520
And when people wanted their money? A wire was coming, she said.

12
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:42,220
A wire is a bank-to-bank transfer, and hers never came.

13
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:46,240
In twenty seventeen, two New York hotels said she skipped her bills.

14
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:49,000
Send this to the friend who always picks up the check.

15
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:52,640
Then came her friend Rachel Williams, a magazine photo editor.

16
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:55,880
On a Morocco trip, the bill landed on Rachel's card.

17
00:00:58,520 --> 00:01:00,480
Sixty-two thousand dollars. That's a year of pay for a lot of people.

18
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:03,680
In October twenty seventeen, she was finally arrested.

19
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,880
Follow if you love watching a fake story fall apart.

20
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:10,960
In twenty nineteen, a Manhattan jury found her guilty on eight counts.

21
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,260
One was grand larceny, which means stealing a lot.

22
00:01:14,740 --> 00:01:17,160
She was sentenced to four to twelve years in prison.

23
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:19,260
And she was ordered to repay about two hundred thousand dollars.

24
00:01:21,100 --> 00:01:24,080
The story sounded rich, but the money never showed up.

25
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,600
Heiress or hustler? One word.

